          "title": "You'll want to know: تلوث",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "تلوث — talawwuth — \"pollution\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "التلوث في المدينة مشكلة كبيرة. at-talawwuth fī al-madīna mushkila kabīra. Pollution in the city is a big problem."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "تلوث (talawwuth) is built on the native Arabic root l-w-th, \"to soil, to stain\" (Lane). It is the verbal noun of Form V, \"becoming soiled\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
